 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Heck, of course. Do you want stick to her favorite foods, or explore new recipes? Ask her about it. She's probably very familiar with what she can still eat. Wheat, barley, and rhy products, like bread, pasta, and beer. Also, any that are deeply baked or steamed. Then look for a gluten free version, or skip it altogether. She might also be able to enjoy soy yogurt and tofu. Then think about sides. Not anymore. Brown rice, couscous, and other grains are now on the table. You can also ask her if she wants you to make something from her favorite gluten free cookbooks.",
